WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Know what you can spend, every day.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Your Plan starts with your Take-home pay.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Take out Commitments, Buckets and Goals.
What's left is Free to Spend.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
This Month puts Free to Spend first.

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
A Bucket's bar fills as you spend. The line is Pace:
where you'd be if you spent evenly.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Connect a bank, and Transactions arrive by themselves.

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Noodle files them for you.
Review asks only about the ones it isn't sure of.

8
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.000
“Always file Costco in Groceries” makes a Rule.

9
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.500
No bank connected? Use Quick Add:
press Q on a computer, or tap + on a phone.

10
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.000
Or upload a statement, or forward a receipt by email.

11
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Same Plan, a bit more typing.

12
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Set money aside for a Goal, or pay off a card or loan.

13
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Explore answers “Can we afford it?” before you spend.

14
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.000
A few minutes each week: the Check-in.

15
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.500
Close the month and Sweep what's left into a Goal.

16
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.000
Invite the other Parent to share the Plan.

17
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Start your Plan
